{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26291","headline":"宿白马津寄寇立 · 沈亚之","name":"宿白马津寄寇立","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客思听蛩嗟，秋怀似乱砂。\n劒头悬日影，蝇鼻落灯花。\n天外归鸿断，漳南别路赊。\n闻君同旅舍，几得梦还家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}